879 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Summary\072\050\050A simplistic pixel art shaded waterfall particle system\050\050Description\072\050\050The waterfall seems to function in local space and has it\031s velocity affected by gravity\056 If you watch closely it seems like there is a 2nd particle emitter at the bottom that shoots water droplets upward to give the impression of water droplets splashing around\056 \n\050Use Case\072\050\050Great for beautiful backgrounds that don\031t take too much of the player\031s attention\056\050\050Effectiveness\072\0504\0575\050Relevance to game studio\072\0501\0575 \055 could be used conservatively in improving visuals of backgrounds)
     /K [ 29 ]
     /P 880 0 R
     /Pg 850 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

