  << /ActualText (Nearby doors there\031s a glimmer of magical\054 blue particles\056\n\nThe light and radiating from the door is used to highlight and bring the viewer\031s eyes towards it\056 The point of the particles origin appears to be from the center of the doorway\056 Each particle has a soft glow to make it more magical\056\n\nIn MoonTower\054 these type of particles could instead be used as ember or fireflies floating across the screen\056)
