895 0 obj
  << /ActualText (When the player collects more cells a burst of particles emits from them\056\n\nIn Dead Cells\054 collecting items is very common so it would be hard to tell if any items were more important than others without the particle effect\056 The similar glow and colour from the door are used again here but instead of slowly floating away the particles accelerate away from the player\056\050\050The particle system could be used for the exact same reason in MoonTower as Dead Cells such as collecting important items\056)
