903 0 obj
  << /ActualText (All throughout the game a fog particle is used to add depth and mystery to the 2D World with the first usage being the title screen\056\n\nThe fog slowly drifts across the screen in a horizontal direction with a style similar to perlin noise\056 It\031s clear that the artists studied how fog works in real life with how the light seems to hit the fog in game\054 making it more visible\056\n\nThis particle effect would be perfect to implement in MoonTower with how simple yet effective it is\056 The effect also seems a bit flexible too where it could be coloured slightly differently to instead be dust\056 Just like Dead Cells\054 it could be used almost everywhere in the game\056)
     /K [ 53 ]
     /P 904 0 R
     /Pg 850 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

