  << /ActualText (Small green drops of acid fall from the top of the screen when in the toxic sewers\056\n\nUse case\072 Adding more foreground elements and building on the environment of the sewer\056\n\nRough recreation\072\nWorld space\nFading trail with constant width\nSpawner above the camera\n\nUsage in GS4\072 A similar effect could be used in the tutorial area \050boiler room\051 since it is underground and meant to be dirty\056\n\nEffectiveness\072 3\nRelevance\072 2)
     /K [ 75 ]
