927 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Environmental bats\nWhen entering most underground areas\054 bats scatter from the doorway\056\n\nUse case\072 Add to the first impression of the area it is found in\056\n\nRough recreation\072\nWorld space\nSprite based\nAccelerate over lifetime\n\nUsage in GS4\072 While bats may not be the most relevant creature for our setting\054 I wanted to highlight this effect because of how it uses particles that are the same color as the background\056 It implies much more space by having the bats seamlessly blend into the wider sewer system\056\n\nEffectiveness\072 4\nRelevance\072 2)
     /K [ 77 ]
     /P 928 0 R
     /Pg 850 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

