929 0 obj
  << /ActualText (When throwing an ice grenade\054 there is an icy outline of the explosion that falls apart\056\n\nUse case\072 Adding a distinct icy feel to the ice grenade\056\n\nRough recreation\072\nWorld space\nSpawn in a ring equal to the explosion radius\nStatic for \1760\0565s\nSlowly become affected by gravity\n\nUsage in GS4\072 Likely not that useful\054 but an interesting type of effect to keep in mind\056 Other particle systems could create a similar \034silhouette\035 effect\056\n\nEffectiveness\072 5\nRelevance\072 1)
     /K [ 79 ]
     /P 930 0 R
     /Pg 850 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
