931 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Enemy Gibs\nMinibosses spawn gibs at half health\054 and most enemies spawn them when they die\056\n\nUse case\072 Used to add satisfaction to combat\056\n\nRough recreation\nWorld space\nSprite based particles\nInteracts with environment colliders\nFade opacity with lifetime\n\nUsage in GS4\072 In order to use them in our game\054 we would have to adapt them to be bits of metal scrap instead of body parts\056 We\031d also need to adjust the blood to be oil\057diesel that spills from \nthe robots\056\n\nEffectiveness\072 4\nRelevance\072 4)
     /K [ 81 ]
     /P 932 0 R
     /Pg 850 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

