933 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Warning Particles\nMost enemies spawn a particle system to telegraph when they are about to attack\056\n\nUse case\072 The universality of the particles means that new enemies can be understood on a \nbasic level by a player who has seen the warning on previous enemies\056 The colors are also chosen to \ncontrast with the environment in the first area\054 which is where this will be most needed for \nthe player\056\n\nRough recreation\072\nLocal space\nTapering trail\nHigh velocity initially that slows with lifetime\nSupplemented with an exclamation mark sprite\n\nUsage in GS4\072 I think telegraphs like these are essential to have on early enemies\054 and would be an essential part of the tutorial in our game\056\n\nEffectiveness\072 5\nRelevance\072 5)
     /K [ 83 ]
     /P 934 0 R
     /Pg 850 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

